<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>
      Welcome to Assessly - Developer Assessment and Coding Platform
    </title>
  </head>

  <body
    style="
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f4f7f9;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    "
  >
    <table
      width="100%"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      style="background-color: #f4f7f9; padding: 40px 15px"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table
            width="100%"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            style="
              max-width: 520px;
              background-color: #ffffff;
              border-radius: 12px;
              overflow: hidden;
              border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            "
          >
            <!-- Header -->
            <tr>
              <td
                style="
                  background-color: #0f766e;
                  padding: 30px 25px;
                  text-align: center;
                "
              >
                <h1
                  style="
                    margin: 0;
                    color: #ffffff;
                    font-size: 25px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                  "
                >
                  Assessly - Developer Assessment and Coding Platform
                </h1>

                <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: #ccfbf1; font-size: 13px">
                  Your trusted Assessly - Developer Assessment and Coding
                  Platform
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Content -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 40px 35px">
                <h2
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 18px;
                    color: #111827;
                    font-size: 23px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                  "
                >
                  Welcome, <%= name %>!
                </h2>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 18px;
                    color: #374151;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    line-height: 1.8;
                  "
                >
                  Thank you for creating your account with
                  <strong
                    >Assessly - Developer Assessment and Coding Platform</strong
                  >. We are delighted to welcome you to our platform.
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 18px;
                    color: #6b7280;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    line-height: 1.8;
                  "
                >
                  Your account has been successfully created and is now ready to
                  use. Assessly - Developer Assessment and Coding Platform is
                  designed to make it easier and more convenient for you to
                  access Assessly - Developer Assessment and Coding Platform
                  services through our platform.
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0;
                    color: #6b7280;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    line-height: 1.8;
                  "
                >
                  We are committed to providing a secure, reliable, and
                  user-friendly experience. You can now sign in to your account
                  and explore the services available to you.
                </p>

                <!-- Welcome Highlight -->
                <div
                  style="
                    margin-top: 30px;
                    padding: 20px;
                    background-color: #f0fdfa;
                    border-left: 4px solid #0f766e;
                    border-radius: 8px;
                  "
                >
                  <p
                    style="
                      margin: 0 0 8px;
                      color: #115e59;
                      font-size: 15px;
                      font-weight: 600;
                    "
                  >
                    Your Assessly - Developer Assessment and Coding Platform
                    journey starts here.
                  </p>

                  <p
                    style="
                      margin: 0;
                      color: #4b5563;
                      font-size: 13px;
                      line-height: 1.7;
                    "
                  >
                    Keep your account information secure and make the most of
                    the Assessly - Developer Assessment and Coding Platform
                    services available through our platform.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 30px 0 0;
                    color: #374151;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                  "
                >
                  If you have any questions or need assistance, please contact
                  our support team. We are always happy to help.
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 25px 0 0;
                    color: #374151;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                  "
                >
                  Once again, welcome to
                  <strong
                    >Assessly - Developer Assessment and Coding Platform</strong
                  >. We look forward to supporting you.
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 30px 0 0;
                    color: #374151;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                  "
                >
                  Best regards,<br />
                  <strong
                    >Assessly - Developer Assessment and Coding Platform
                    Team</strong
                  >
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <tr>
              <td
                style="
                  padding: 24px 30px;
                  background-color: #f8fafc;
                  text-align: center;
                  border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
                "
              >
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 7px;
                    color: #6b7280;
                    font-size: 13px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                  "
                >
                  Assessly - Developer Assessment and Coding Platform
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0;
                    color: #9ca3af;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                  "
                >
                  Your trusted Assessly - Developer Assessment and Coding
                  Platform
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px">
                  © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Assessly - Developer
                  Assessment and Coding Platform. All rights reserved.
                </p>

                <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 11px">
                  This is an automated email. Please do not reply.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
